# Project architecture

- Read `docs/PROJECT_DESIGN.md` before implementation.
- Keep local desktop and public Community services in separate modules and processes.
- Treat Project directories and Agent source files as user-owned source truth.
- Keep secrets, runs, events, caches, and account tokens outside Project directories.
- Do not introduce generic catch-all modules or cross-layer database access.
- Do not copy runtime state or imports from the legacy repository.
- Preserve unrelated work and stay inside the assigned directory ownership.
- Finish changes with focused tests and report the exact commit SHA.

